        "level": 1,
        "name": "Occultist",
        "description": "<p>You gain a Perk with the Trained: Mysticism Prerequisite, and you can Cast Spells using Mysticism.</p><p><strong>Spells:</strong> You learn 4 Spells. You learn 1 other Spell every 2 Levels hereafter.</p><p><strong>Mana:</strong> Your Max Mana is equal to (4 × your Level), and your Cast Max for Spells is equal to (2 + your Level).</p>",
